### HƯỚNG DẪN
# File này dùng với extension "REST Client" (Huachao Mao) trong VSCode.
# Cài xong, mỗi block dưới đây sẽ hiện link "Send Request" phía trên - bấm vào để gọi.
# Chạy server trước: python manage.py runserver
#
# Các biến @xxx = {{tenRequest.response.body.$.duong.dan}} sẽ TỰ ĐỘNG lấy giá trị từ response
# của request phía trên (đã đặt tên bằng dòng "# @name tenRequest") - cứ chạy lần lượt từ
# trên xuống dưới, không cần copy-paste tay token/id.
#
# Những chỗ cần bạn tự điền tay (đánh dấu "<-- ĐIỀN TAY"): order_index/option_id lấy từ
# response của "GET .../questions/" ở ngay phía trên, vì mỗi lần seed random khác nhau.

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000


### ========================================================================
### 0. TẠO 2 TÀI KHOẢN TEST (bỏ qua nếu đã có sẵn - sẽ báo lỗi "đã tồn tại")
### ========================================================================

### Đăng ký user 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tester_p1",
  "password": "Test@1234",
  "display_name": "Tester P1"
}

### Đăng ký user 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tester_p2",
  "password": "Test@1234",
  "display_name": "Tester P2"
}


### ========================================================================
### 1. LOGIN (bắt buộc chạy trước mọi thứ khác - lấy token)
### ========================================================================

### Login P1
# @name loginP1
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tester_p1",
  "password": "Test@1234"
}

###
@tokenP1 = {{loginP1.response.body.$.data.session_id}}
@userId1 = {{loginP1.response.body.$.data.user.user_id}}

### Login P2
# @name loginP2
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tester_p2",
  "password": "Test@1234"
}

###
@userId2 = {{loginP2.response.body.$.data.user.user_id}}
@sessionP2 = {{loginP2.response.body.$.data.session_id}}


### ========================================================================
### 2. AUTH / PRESENCE co ban (Dev 1 - test nhanh xem token con song khong)
### ========================================================================

### GET /me (P1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me/
Authorization: {{tokenP1}}

### Heartbeat P1 (bat buoc goi dinh ky moi 3-5s trong app that de giu online)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/session/heartbeat/
Authorization: {{tokenP1}}

### Heartbeat P2
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/session/heartbeat/
Authorization: {{sessionP2}}

### Danh sach nguoi choi dang online (P2 phai thay trong list nay thi moi thach dau duoc)
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard/online-players/
Authorization: {{tokenP1}}


### ========================================================================
### 3. BOT MATCH FLOW (#19-#25) - chi can 1 nguoi, khong can doi thu that
### ========================================================================

### Tao tran voi bot
# bot_difficulty: "easy" | "medium" | "hard"
# @name createBotMatch
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/bot/
Authorization: {{tokenP1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bot_difficulty": "medium",
  "question_count": 5,
  "time_limit_seconds": 60
}

###
@botMatchId = {{createBotMatch.response.body.$.match_id}}

### Xem thong tin phong choi
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{botMatchId}}/
Authorization: {{tokenP1}}

### Lay de bai (COPY order_index + option_id tu day de dien vao 2 request ben duoi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{botMatchId}}/questions/
Authorization: {{tokenP1}}

### Luu tam dap an dang chon (PUT - co the goi nhieu lan, F5 khong mat bai)
# <-- DIEN TAY: thay order_index/selected_option_id bang gia tri that lay tu response tren
PUT {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{botMatchId}}/answers/
Authorization: {{tokenP1}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "order_index": 0, "selected_option_id": 1 },
  { "order_index": 1, "selected_option_id": 5 }
]

### Poll trang thai tran (goi lien tuc moi 1s trong app that)
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{botMatchId}}/state/
Authorization: {{tokenP1}}

### Nop bai (submit toan bo dap an cuoi cung)
# <-- DIEN TAY: dien du 5 cau (order_index 0..4) voi option_id tuong ung
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{botMatchId}}/submit/
Authorization: {{tokenP1}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "order_index": 0, "selected_option_id": 1 },
  { "order_index": 1, "selected_option_id": 5 },
  { "order_index": 2, "selected_option_id": 9 },
  { "order_index": 3, "selected_option_id": 13 },
  { "order_index": 4, "selected_option_id": 17 }
]

### Xem ket qua cuoi (ai thang, dap an dung tung cau)
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{botMatchId}}/result/
Authorization: {{tokenP1}}


### ========================================================================
### 4. CHALLENGE + PVP MATCH FLOW (#14-#18, #20-#26)
### Nho chay lai phan (2) Heartbeat cho ca P1 va P2 truoc khi thach dau,
### de dam bao ca 2 dang "online + idle" (khong bi coi la busy/offline).
### ========================================================================

### P1 thach dau P2
# @name createChallenge
POST {{baseUrl}}/challenges/
Authorization: {{tokenP1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "opponent_id": {{userId2}}
}

###
@challengeId = {{createChallenge.response.body.$.challenge_id}}

### P2 xem loi thach dau (thuong lay qua heartbeat, day la cach poll rieng)
GET {{baseUrl}}/challenges/{{challengeId}}/
Authorization: {{sessionP2}}

### P2 dong y (Accept) -> tao tran + 2 match_participants + sinh de
# @name acceptChallenge
POST {{baseUrl}}/challenges/{{challengeId}}/accept/
Authorization: {{sessionP2}}

###
@pvpMatchId = {{acceptChallenge.response.body.$.match_id}}

# --- Cac request duoi day chay 1 lan cho MOI request rieng theo tung nguoi ---

### (Thay the) P2 tu choi loi thach dau - CHI DUNG KHI MUON TEST REJECT thay vi Accept o tren
POST {{baseUrl}}/challenges/{{challengeId}}/reject/
Authorization: {{sessionP2}}

### (Thay the) P1 tu rut lai loi thach dau - CHI DUNG KHI MUON TEST CANCEL
POST {{baseUrl}}/challenges/{{challengeId}}/cancel/
Authorization: {{tokenP1}}

### P1 xem cau hoi cua tran PvP
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{pvpMatchId}}/questions/
Authorization: {{tokenP1}}

### P2 xem cau hoi (cung mot de voi P1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{pvpMatchId}}/questions/
Authorization: {{sessionP2}}

### P1 nop bai (dien tay dap an theo de that nhan duoc o tren, mac dinh 10 cau)
# <-- DIEN TAY
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{pvpMatchId}}/submit/
Authorization: {{tokenP1}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "order_index": 0, "selected_option_id": 1 },
  { "order_index": 1, "selected_option_id": 5 }
]

### P2 poll xem P1 nop chua
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{pvpMatchId}}/state/
Authorization: {{sessionP2}}

### P2 nop bai
# <-- DIEN TAY
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{pvpMatchId}}/submit/
Authorization: {{sessionP2}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "order_index": 0, "selected_option_id": 1 },
  { "order_index": 1, "selected_option_id": 5 }
]

### Xem ket qua tran PvP (goi duoc boi ca P1 lan P2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{pvpMatchId}}/result/
Authorization: {{tokenP1}}

### (Tuy chon) P1 bo cuoc giua tran - CHI GOI KHI TRAN CON DANG "ongoing"
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{pvpMatchId}}/quit/
Authorization: {{tokenP1}}


### ========================================================================
### 5. LEADERBOARD / STATS (Dev 1 - de doi chieu diem sau khi test xong)
### ========================================================================

### BXH
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard/leaderboard/
Authorization: {{tokenP1}}

### Thong ke ca nhan P1
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard/users/{{userId1}}/stats/
Authorization: {{tokenP1}}

### Lich su tran cua P1
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard/users/{{userId1}}/matches/
Authorization: {{tokenP1}}


### ========================================================================
### 6. LOGOUT
### ========================================================================

### Logout P1
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout/
Authorization: {{tokenP1}}

### Logout P2
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout/
Authorization: {{sessionP2}}
